  {
   "text": "Chris twisted his ankle and crawled into his emergency bivy on the snow.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 4.631
  },
  {
   "text": "He stayed cold, because the cold came from the ground.",
   "start": 4.781,
   "end": 7.751
  },
  {
   "text": "The rule: dry layers and hat on first, then sit on your pack.",
   "start": 8.001,
   "end": 11.562
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next winter hike.",
   "start": 11.862,
   "end": 13.717
  }
